  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "Heyo!\nDon't know entirely what's going on behind the scenes, but custom portals seem to be broken if using a Button to `GameObject.BroadcastMessage` -> `Enter` on a VRC_Portal. \nThis breaks custom portals such as Hardlight's Doortals in the prefab database: https://tinyurl.com/vrcprefabs\nCyan was sayin' something about IL2CPP not including this method with the 2018 update.  If that could get included, or a workaround provided, that'd be great. :) Thanks.",
